@startuml
title Benchmark protocol
skinparam dpi 600
hide empty description
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

NLVCorpus --> NLVSingleTurnFilter
NLVSingleTurnFilter --> NoRAGRun
NLVSingleTurnFilter --> RAGRunCurrent
NLVSingleTurnFilter --> RAGRunAutoRAG

NoRAGRun --> PairedComparison
RAGRunCurrent --> PairedComparison
RAGRunAutoRAG --> PairedComparison
PairedComparison --> NLVReport

InfiAgentDataset --> ChartAnswerableFilter
ChartAnswerableFilter --> InfiAgentRAGRun
InfiAgentRAGRun --> InfiAgentReport

note right of NLVReport
Primary metrics:
- mean_spec_score
- failure_as_zero
- visualization_error_rate
- empty_chart_rate
- improved/degraded paired cases
- token and duration overhead
end note

note right of InfiAgentReport
Analytics tail is enabled here.
The system must answer from the chart,
not directly from the table.
end note
@enduml
